                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've raced the \"Screamer\" game series since their release in 1995-1996-1997.  Using 3dfx graphics greatly improves your visual interface.  I play on both a vintage Windows98se setup and my current Windows11 computer.  Whilst the game is simple enough in terms of opening new tracks and cars, it is a bit of a buzz competing your skills against AI computer cars.  Difficulty increases with advancement. through the championships. Try all cars in all Teams and play with your customisations to get the best setups.  30 years on, I'm still enjoying this game and others of that era. Very nostalgic... sometimes better games than some of the modern developments, but that's up to what the player wants.",
